{"answer_text":"A shared inbox is often enough for small support teams before a full help desk. The best-rated:\n\n1. **Brightdesk Helpdesk**: A dependable help desk with SLAs, macros and detailed reporting.\n2. **Calmline**: A calm, fast shared inbox with collision detection and CRM sidebars.\n3. **Northwind CRM**: Its service module links tickets to accounts, at enterprise prices.\n\nA quick way to decide: if support is your main workflow, go with Brightdesk; otherwise Calmline keeps things simpler.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50ed-72ed-a7c4-18b5016784d1","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0122,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:49.900Z","engine":"claude","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["shared inbox vs help desk"],"latency_ms":10250,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a0332cede9","market_name":"United States","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[102,112],[432,442]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[195,203]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[281,294]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."}],"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","prompt_id":"01a1f315-4dcf-76a1-bfe0-6a96ebe4716c